  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educating in Human Rights, Promoting their Enforcement Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this Agreement is to strengthen the work of the IIHR in implementing the activities of the Strategic Framework 2015-2020, as well as the strategic institutional plan, The institutional emphasis is to maintain the IIHR as an Inter-American recognized institution in promoting education and specialized training in human rights, as well as a centre of regional reflection, generator of knowledge, actions and investigation.</narrative>
  </description>
